        "```markdown\n",
        "# ContractGuard AI: Enterprise-Grade Smart Contract Security Auditing Platform\n",
        "\n",
        "ContractGuard AI combines static analysis, gas optimization rules, access-control graph representations, and **Google Gemini AI** to produce instant, professional-grade security audits for Solidity smart contracts.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Core System Components Installed below:\n",
        "1. **Enterprise Dashboard & Database Store**: Tracks contracts, vulnerability trends, and security scores.\n",
        "2. **Multi-Method Auditing Core**: Runs deterministic regex/rules (simulating Slither) + Gemini AI Auditing.\n",
        "3. **Interactive Dark Theme Workspace UI**: File upload, code paste, interactive vulnerability graphs, and remediation playground.\n",
        "```"
